From: Kevin Rajan <7121943+kvnloo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 04:13:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add P1 control table and mushroom-body Hermes specialist.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Track A now includes a local-plasticity family: frozen sparse PN→KC on
flattened Hermes history (not the compound eye) with only KC→MBON plastic.
`python -m evolution_lab table` writes the kill criterion; advise maps a
sanitized observation to {retry, restart_sandbox, escalate, noop, page_human}.
