MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

PN drive is flatten + last-step + max-over-time (delayed cue is a PN, not
SGD through MaleCNS). 640 plastic KC→MBON weights reach confirm 1.00 and
val ~0.98 on the locked split, cheaper than the ridge MLP. Kill criterion
still does not fire; MaleCNS SGD remains refused. vs_teacher breaks ties
by cost.
